# Host-only HMAC key for reviewer isolation receipts (round 21, finding #1).
# Committing it would make every clone able to sign a receipt claiming a
# reviewer was confined, which is exactly the forgery the key exists to stop.
.launcher_hmac_key

# Scratch workspace the reviewer launcher writes bundles into. Round 21 left a
# red-phase artifact here (a bundle created before the deny-subtree guard
# existed) and it showed up as a repo file.
experiments/*/audit_workspace/
